Error [E0320]: struct construction uses `Record{…}`, not `Record.{…}`
  --> tests/ui/cffi_out_pointer_requires_unsafe.jet:15:20
    |
 15 |     slot := Record.{id: 0}
    |                    ^
 Why: literal heads place no dot before their brace (D-LIT-DOT1)
 Fix: write `Record{…}`

Error [E3103]: `invoke` is an `#Unsafe` function
  --> tests/ui/cffi_out_pointer_requires_unsafe.jet:20:12
    |
 20 | fn run() { invoke() }
    |            ^^^^^^
 Why: its contract can't be checked by the compiler, so the caller must vouch for it
 Fix: call it inside `#Unsafe("…") { … }`
